<!--
  TrebleDroid GSI parts on top of LineageOS 24.0 (Android 17), proof of concept.
  Neither TrebleDroid nor MisterZtr had Android 17 when this was put together
  (2026-10). The device side is the same as for lineage-23.2 (RestlessOS's
  android-17.0 branches of device_phh_treble and vendor_interfaces point to the very
  commits pinned here), so MisterZtr's LineageOS_gsi (lineage-23.2) still provides
  the LineageOS targets and its device_phh_treble patches. The Android 17 ports of
  TrebleDroid's platform patches and the legacy-kernel patches come from RestlessOS
  (cawilliamson/treble_restlessos, android-17.0), a GrapheneOS-based GSI; the ones
  that needed rebasing onto LineageOS's forks are in patches/lineage-24.0/ (see
  CLAUDE.md). Third-party repositories are pinned to the commits current on
  2026-10-28, so an upstream change cannot silently break the patches; LineageOS
  repositories follow the branch (hardware/oplus included).
-->
